---
config:
  sequence:
    mirrorActors: false
    actorMargin: 52
    messageMargin: 32
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Producer
    participant API as Ingestion API
    participant Worker as Background worker
    participant Store as Transactional store
    participant UI as Dashboard

    Producer->>API: Submit observation batch
    activate API
    API->>API: Validate complete batch
    alt invalid batch or conflicting event ID
        API-->>Producer: Reject without persistence
    else accepted batch
        API->>Store: Create jobs atomically
        Store-->>API: Commit receipt
        API-->>Producer: Accept batch
    end
    deactivate API

    loop each available job
        Worker->>Store: Claim with processing lease
        Store-->>Worker: Canonical observation
        Worker->>Worker: Execute verified cascade
        alt inference committed
            Worker->>Store: Commit result, transition, and outbox event
            Store-->>Worker: Transaction committed
            Worker-)UI: Publish committed prediction or alert
        else processing failed
            Worker->>Store: Commit retry or dead-letter transition
        end
    end

    note over Worker,Store: Publication occurs only after the database transaction commits.
